+# Exact-pass midpoint parametric family
+
+The native parameter is `passes`:
+
+- `1` is the exact canonical Racket program, byte-for-byte.
+- `2` applies the same midpoint rule to the first-pass result once more.
+
+Every generated scene contains both horizontal-first and vertical-first
+three-stage cascades.  The first pass creates a colored endpoint; the second
+pass must inspect that intermediate grid to choose a newly active midpoint.  A
+third possible fill remains absent, separating exactly two passes from closure.
+The adapter supports 2–6 demonstrations and exactly four distinct queries; the
+last query is a populated 30×30 boundary case.
+
+Focused check from the outer packet directory:
+
+```bash
+python3 review.py run python3 -m pytest \
+  generators/fe54bfae4cee/tests/test_parametric_pass_depth.py -q
+```
+
+Bounded protected-Racket and teaching audit:
+
+```bash
+python3 review.py run python3 \
+  generators/fe54bfae4cee/workspace/parametric/audit.py \
+  --out generators/fe54bfae4cee/workspace/parametric/evidence/current/self_audit.json
+```
